  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "T2 依赖 T1 —— 这条边在图上存在且方向一致，逐字核对 ID 后确认。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "T8 依赖 T7 —— 同一条工作流内的普通边，也必须能重算。 （tier 判据已对齐其余 9 域：locator 自带本域所需字段且图核验通过 -> declared-locator。）",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T8",
            "to": "T7"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T7"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T8",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T7",
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "枚举器的叫法：`dependency-edge` 与 `task-edge` 是同一条有向边，另外逐字核 `edgeKind` —— T2 dependsOn T1。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "dependency-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "T1",
            "edgeKind": "depends-on"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "枚举器的节点卡：`task-node` 断言该任务在计划里有一条记录 —— 逐字定位到 T1。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-node",
            "taskId": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "枚举器的风险卡：`risk-entry` 断言这条风险登记项存在 —— 逐字定位到 R1。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "risk-entry",
            "riskId": "R1",
            "owners": [
              "bob"
            ]
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [],
                "risks": [
                  {
                    "id": "R1",
                    "trigger": "合作方结算接口延期交付",
                    "mitigation": "10-15 前索取接口契约"
