        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      },
      {
        "note": "ID 逐字：模型把 T1 写成 t1。图是小写不敏感的数据库不会发生这种事，但导出/粘贴会 —— 逐字比较必须拒绝，而不是大小写折叠后放行。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "t1"
